############### Users ###################



### Register new user 
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "brucewayne",
  "email": "batman@gotham.com",
  "password": "supersecretpassword"
}

###

### Login with email (auto-capturing token)
# @name loginWithEmail
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "batman@gotham.com",
  "password": "supersecretpasword"
}

###

### Login with username
# @name loginWithUsername
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "brucewayne",
  "password": "supersecretpassword"
}




################## Books ################### 


### GET all books (fails, no token)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books

###

### Get Protected Books (email login)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books
Authorization: Bearer {{loginWithEmail.response.body.token}}

### Get Protected Books (username login)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books
Authorization: Bearer {{loginWithUsername.response.body.token}}


### GET single book (Replace 12345 with a real _id from step 1)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books/6aacb51afb830b0dc5d

###

### 6. Create a Book under Logged-in User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/books
Authorization: Bearer {{loginWithEmail.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Dark Knight Returns",
  "author": "Frank Miller",
  "status": "Finished"
}

### PUT (Update a book - Replace 12345 with a real _id)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/books/6ab4b8ef8e04d1c4930d407e
Authorization: Bearer {{loginWithEmail.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "To read"
}

###

### DELETE a book (Replace 12345 with a real _id)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/books/6ab4b8ef8e04d1c4930d407e
Authorization: Bearer {{loginWithEmail.response.body.token}}
